      "message": "[error] Line 149: 🔴 `chmod a+rwx /usr/local/cargo` still makes the parent of the PATH entry world-writable, so an unprivileged build can rename/replace `/usr/local/cargo/bin` and inject fake `cargo`/`rustc` for later steps. Keep `/usr/local/cargo` and its `bin` read-only, and use a separate writable Cargo cache/home that is not on PATH.",
