      "message": "[error] Line 28: 🔴 `chmod a+rwx /usr/local/cargo` still allows any package build user to replace entries under `/usr/local/cargo`, including the `bin` directory that is first on PATH. This preserves the toolchain-tampering risk; keep the installed Cargo/Rust tree read-only and point writable Cargo state to a separate directory outside PATH.",
